:: RobinTemple Promise End
<!-- 原版 passage：Sydney Temple Pure Ritual 2 / Sydney Temple Pure Sex / Sydney Temple Pure Sex Finish。流程与结算照原版。罗宾的性爱台词按其人设重写（原版爱语为 "I love you."，不是悉尼的 "I really, really love you."）。 -->

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin'>>
  <<endevent>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person2>>

  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      As the wax continues to pour down, it quickly slides off of you and onto the altar. One of the <<person2>><<monks>> begins to collect it in an empty jar. "Release." The restraints retract, freeing you. The <<monks>> help you up, putting you in a sitting position on the edge of the altar.
      <br><br>
      "The ritual is done," Jordan says, "but there's just one final step. We must prepare you for your new chastity exams." A <<monk>> approaches you with a jar of grey powder. <<He>> opens it, begins to rub it on your <<genitals>>. You turn away, and see Robin getting the same treatment from another <<monk>>. After a moment, they scrape the powder away into the jar of melted wax. It begins to sparkle.
      <br><br>
      "This powder will be used in your exams from now on," Jordan explains as another <<monk>> hands <<him>> a small box. <<He>> opens it, revealing two silver rings. <<He>> gingerly places one on your ring finger, and the other on Robin's.
      <br><br>
      "You are bound. Congratulations again." You notice a pair of <<monks>> folding your clothes, before placing them on the altar. "We will give you two some... privacy, and clean up when you're done. The cushions and blankets will be burned to remove any impurities from this site. What you do now, the order will be blinded to." Jordan gives you both a gentle smile, and begins to leave with the other <<monks>>. "I hope you both find happiness in this decision."
      <br><br>
      You're left alone with Robin, hearing the doors lock. <<person1>>"S...so this is it?" Robin looks to you, still attempting to keep <<person1>><<his>> eyes off your body.
      <br><br>
      <<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
        "I... I think so. Are you ready?" you ask quietly.
      <<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
        "About time. Ready?" you ask.
      <<else>>
        "I think so. Are you ready?" you ask.
      <</if>>
      <br>
      Robin smiles at you. "I'm ready." <<He>> wraps <<his>> arms around you and kisses you. You both fall back onto the cushioned altar. <<takeKissVirginity "Robin" `($robinromance is 1?"loveInterest":"romantic")`>>
      <br><br>
      You've gained the <span class="blue">Rite of Promise: Robin</span> trait.
      <br><br>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      蜡烛不断融化流淌，顺着你的身体滑落至圣坛边缘。一名<<person2>><<monks>>拿出一只空罐，小心收集起流淌的蜡液。“解。”随着一声低诵，象牙束具应声收回，解开了你们的双手。修道士们搀扶着你们坐起身，让你们并肩坐在圣坛边缘。
      <br><br>
      “仪式已经礼成，”约旦朝你们温和点头，“但尚有最后一事。我们须为你们往后的贞洁检验做准备。”一名手捧盛满灰色粉末玻璃罐的<<monk>>走向你们。<<He>>旋开罐盖，取粉末轻柔抹在你的<<genitals>>上。你微侧过头，只见另一名修道士也正对罗宾做着同样的事。片刻后，他们将粉末刮入盛满熔蜡的罐中，蜡液随即泛起了细碎明亮的微光。
      <br><br>
      “自此刻起，这坛粉末便将用于你们往后的每一次贞洁检验。”约旦一边说明，一边接过另一名<<monk>>递来的锦盒。<<He>>打开盒盖，两枚银戒正静静卧于丝绒之上。<<He>>小心翼翼地将戒指分别戴在你与罗宾的无名指上。
      <br><br>
      “你们已正式立誓结缘，再次恭喜二位。”你注意到两名<<monk>>叠整好你们的衣物，放置在圣坛一侧。“我们会留给二位一些……独处的时光，待一切结束后自会前来洒扫。这些软垫与毛毯事后皆会付之一炬，以涤除留在此处的任何不洁。你们在此间所行的一切，修会上下皆会视若无睹。”约旦朝你们露出温柔的微笑，与其他修道士一同退出了房间。“愿你们在这个决定中觅得彼此的幸福。”
      <br><br>
      落锁声在门后响起，整间静室只剩下了你和罗宾二人。<<person1>>“所……所以，就是现在了吗？”罗宾抬眼望向你，目光仍局促地不敢在你赤裸的身上多作停留。
      <br><br>
