      <br><br>
      你获得了<span class="blue">承诺仪式：罗宾</span>特质。
      <br><br>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The ceremony cannot continue. You need to speak to Jordan and Robin again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
